    "c_content_panel_gCFtaP": {
      "type": "c-content-panel",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_89dd7i": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "NANGA×STORM Cleaner: A Home Cleaning Kit Designed with the Environment in Mind"
          }
        },
        "text_TXRcgJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Outdoor wear does not have to be sent to a cleaner only at the end of the season. Maintaining it at home whenever it gets dirty during the season also helps preserve its performance and extend its lifespan. NANGA has partnered with STORM, a UK based company that creates environmentally conscious products, to offer a down maintenance kit that completes in a single wash cycle, saving time, water, and electricity. The packaging uses a custom aluminum bottle designed with microplastic pollution in mind.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
